      "content": "uh, what? why are you talking about goblins and traps? i'm just trying to fix my inventory records. \n\ncan we just stick to the actual logistics stuff? please focus on the technical reasons for the shrinkage. what are the most likely real-world causes for these specific types of discrepancies in a warehouse setting?",
